    "SpamWise includes the open-source software below. The complete notices are in CREDITS.md in the [SpamWise repository](https://github.com/RISCfuture/SpamWise).\n\n**ClaudeForFoundationModels** (revision 0262e1a). Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.\n\n**swift-log**. Copyright 2018–2019 The SwiftLog Project. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Contains a derivation of the lock implementation from SwiftNIO.\n\n**SwiftNIO** and **swift-nio-imap**. Copyright Apple Inc. and the SwiftNIO project authors. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.\n\n**Public Suffix List**. Licensed under the Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0. Source: [publicsuffix.org](https://publicsuffix.org/list/).\n\nThe downloadable edition also includes **GitHubUpdateChecker**, **swift-markdown-ui** and **NetworkImage**, licensed under the MIT License, and **swift-cmark**, licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.\n\nThe Apache License, Version 2.0 is available at [apache.org](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).\n\nSpamWise is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Anthropic. Claude is a trademark of Anthropic PBC.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SpamWise incluye el software de código abierto que se indica a continuación. Los avisos completos están en CREDITS.md, en el [repositorio de SpamWise](https://github.com/RISCfuture/SpamWise).\n\n**ClaudeForFoundationModels** (revisión 0262e1a). Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC. Con licencia Apache, versión 2.0.\n\n**swift-log**. Copyright 2018–2019 The SwiftLog Project. Con licencia Apache, versión 2.0. Contiene una derivación de la implementación de bloqueos de SwiftNIO.\n\n**SwiftNIO** y **swift-nio-imap**. Copyright Apple Inc. y los autores del proyecto SwiftNIO. Con licencia Apache, versión 2.0.\n\n**Public Suffix List**. Con licencia pública de Mozilla, versión 2.0. Fuente: [publicsuffix.org](https://publicsuffix.org/list/).\n\nLa edición descargable también incluye **GitHubUpdateChecker**, **swift-markdown-ui** y **NetworkImage**, con licencia MIT, y **swift-cmark**, con licencia BSD de 2 cláusulas.\n\nLa licencia Apache, versión 2.0 está disponible en [apache.org](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).\n\nSpamWise no está afiliada, respaldada ni patrocinada por Anthropic. Claude es una marca comercial de Anthropic PBC."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SpamWise inclut les logiciels libres ci-dessous. Les mentions complètes figurent dans CREDITS.md, dans le [dépôt SpamWise](https://github.com/RISCfuture/SpamWise).\n\n**ClaudeForFoundationModels** (révision 0262e1a). Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC. Sous licence Apache, version 2.0.\n\n**swift-log**. Copyright 2018–2019 The SwiftLog Project. Sous licence Apache, version 2.0. Contient une dérivation de l’implémentation des verrous de SwiftNIO.\n\n**SwiftNIO** et **swift-nio-imap**. Copyright Apple Inc. et les auteurs du projet SwiftNIO. Sous licence Apache, version 2.0.\n\n**Public Suffix List**. Sous licence publique Mozilla, version 2.0. Source : [publicsuffix.org](https://publicsuffix.org/list/).\n\nL’édition téléchargeable inclut aussi **GitHubUpdateChecker**, **swift-markdown-ui** et **NetworkImage**, sous licence MIT, et **swift-cmark**, sous licence BSD à 2 clauses.\n\nLa licence Apache, version 2.0 est disponible sur [apache.org](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).\n\nSpamWise n’est ni affiliée à Anthropic, ni approuvée ou parrainée par Anthropic. Claude est une marque d’Anthropic PBC."
          }
        }
      }
